{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["And let them gather all the food — by an official." "Pharaoh — and all this was under duress, imposed on the Egyptians; therefore Scripture writes: ויפקד פקידים ויצברו, for thus we find in Ahasuerus: ויפקד המלך פקידים בכל מדינות מלכותו ויקבצו את כל נערה וגו׳ אל יד הגי וגו׳." "And let them gather — this is the collection from the owners of the fields." "And let them store — this is the gathering by the treasurers. And so you find in Joseph: ויקבוץ ויצבור אכל בערים, for in each and every city they were able to sell during the years of famine."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:59.175200705Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}